


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_dd94f98a:



    voice "2FU_0146"
    fumi "「嗯～风好凉啊。阳菜你没事吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_0b0afba5:


    "文关上门时缩了缩肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_ec736c26:



    voice "2HI_0176"
    hina "「戴着小文亲手织的围巾的我是所向无敌的♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_66890d8e:


    "阳菜自豪地挺起胸。看来北风也很难从这位旅人（少女）身上吹走围巾。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_bcadf3e0:



    voice "2FU_0147"
    fumi "「这是之前练习时织的，阳菜能围上太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_27e1127e:



    voice "2HI_0177"
    hina "「超暖和，而且好可爱。谢谢♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_7e145f56:


    "现在阳菜身上戴着的围巾是年底在文的家里收到的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_6a66b3e8:


    "文看阳菜还穿着单薄的衣服，替她围上了围巾。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_15fd2aa7:



    voice "2FU_0148"
    fumi "「我不会再让阳菜感冒了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_53135b6b:


    "这次换文很自豪的说道。毕竟之前阳菜生病那次没少让她担心。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_b083b2f6:



    voice "2HI_0178"
    hina "「伦她还好吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_f23e95b6:



    voice "2FU_0149"
    fumi "「希望两人别搞得气氛很僵」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_01e2a889:



    voice "2HI_0179"
    hina "「我倒不担心鹰冈同学……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_9703318d:



    voice "2FU_0150"
    fumi "「……担心的是绪方同学呢。虽然她本人说了没事」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_76d1e699:


    "没错，文和阳菜当时十分啰嗦地向伦确认了好几次。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_0e0ee2f8:


    "虽然是伦提议叫她们俩先回家的，可她本来就是个认生的人，所以很是担心她。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_4029272f:



    voice "2HI_0180"
    hina "「她好像还说了什么二位还请“好好休息”，什么自由时间的，也不懂是什么意思」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_dc415503:



    voice "2FU_0151"
    fumi "「自由时间？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_00a5caa2:


    "看来文也没明白，不过要是当时在场时明白了什么意思，伦肯定会被阳菜踹飞。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_d438fc6c:



    voice "2HI_0181"
    hina "「不过我们现在在这瞎操心也没用」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_b1691470:


    "这两个人一直都很关心伦，可能比她们俩自己的事还要在乎。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_f61ee42f:


    "而伦也察觉到了这一点。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_d962a89f:



    voice "2HI_0182"
    hina "「难得的二人时间，我们好好亲近下吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_5c9c9e9c:



    voice "2FU_0152"
    fumi "「是啊，一会要感谢下绪方同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_95085f7b:


    "两人看着彼此点点头，注视对方，牵手，抱在一起。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_ecc67c59:



    voice "2HI_0183"
    hina "「小文……我喜欢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_ddf0dc25:



    voice "2FU_0153"
    fumi "「我也是……喜欢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_4ae27303:


    "午后只有两个人的客厅。无论脱衣服的声音、吐息还是轻声娇笑、能听到的一切全都是她们二人的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_9f52b404:



    voice "2HI_0184"
    hina "「好香」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_02feae4b:


    "阳菜把头埋在文的胸间。因为身高差，两人抱在一起时会很自然的变成这个姿势。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_818a30ce:



    voice "2FU_0154"
    fumi "「可能是柔顺剂的味道？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_e8fcec81:



    voice "2HI_0185"
    hina "「我能凭这个味道找到小文在哪里喔」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_98324c9c:



    voice "2FU_0155"
    fumi "「市场上到处都有卖这个的，其他用过的人也是这个味道吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_8027fdc1:


    "阳菜应该也是一样的味道的，就算洗发水用的不一样，但衣服的柔顺剂是一起用的。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_4afaf3d6:



    voice "2HI_0186"
    hina "「小文身上的就是不一样的♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_2d28f7d7:


    "阳菜得意地露齿一笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_7b37848e:


    "虽然这句话毫无根据，但总感觉只要是她就一定能找到文。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_47ace026:



    voice "2HI_0187"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_2ef6b12c:


    "阳菜稍稍踮起脚尖，霸占住文的嘴唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_07b85f67:


    "不一会儿便充斥起吐息声，两人很默契地用舌尖撬开彼此的唇。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_600ccbe0:


    "舌头在彼此的唇齿间游走交缠，本来同步的吐息声再次错开变得紊乱。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_33d61e8f:



    voice "2HI_0188"
    hina "「小文……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_e89b85a8:



    voice "2FU_0156"
    fumi "「是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_16a4d120:


    "蒙上水雾的眼眸互相注视着彼此，仅是这样便能明白对方充斥着的欲望。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a07_cou1_03_0fd4d656:


    "…………"
